; (:m :ref QW-ALLOC :do "rows repinned from this file own main on the tree merged with PKG: listrt.cell takes the cons pool (gcAsl.allocFastCons) and strrt.slice and listrt.sliceOr branch to strrt.single on a one-byte copy, so each module emitting them grows")
